    "PR description: 'Relative to Testnet 4 it removes the 20-minute minimum-difficulty exception, raises the minimum difficulty, and enforces BIP 54 from block 1.'",
    "PR description references IRC discussion agreeing to settle Testnet 5 changes alongside BIP 54 before shipping in a release."
  ],
