  "card": "Adds Testnet 5 (BIP 95) parameters, seed nodes, kernel bindings, and command-line options to Bitcoin Core. Testnet 5 eliminates the 20-minute minimum-difficulty rule that caused block storms on Testnet 3 and Testnet 4, raises the minimum difficulty, and enforces BIP 54 (Consensus Cleanup) rules starting from block 1. The pull request is stacked on top of unmerged prerequisite PR #35793 (BIP 54), with only the top seven commits specific to Testnet 5. The genesis block has not yet been mined.",
